# Feature name: Normalized_Age_and_Engine_Capacity_Product
# Feature description: Product of normalized Age_of_Driver and Engine_Capacity_(CC).
# Usefulness: Driver's age and engine capacity of the vehicle may together influence driving patterns and behaviors that could indirectly correlate with the driver's sex. Normalizing age scales the data to make it comparable across the population.
